<view class="page">
  <view class="blob blob-one"></view>
  <view class="blob blob-two"></view>

  <view class="card">
    <view class="eyebrow">NEXT STEP</view>
    <view class="title">先绑定一只 Puppy</view>
    <view class="subtitle">
      账号已经准备好。接下来把 Puppy 和这个微信账号绑定，之后它才能记住你的档案和陪伴记录。
    </view>

    <view class="steps">
      <view class="step">
        <view class="step-dot">1</view>
        <view class="step-text">让 Puppy 进入配网模式</view>
      </view>
      <view class="step">
        <view class="step-dot">2</view>
        <view class="step-text">用蓝牙发送家里的 2.4GHz Wi-Fi</view>
      </view>
      <view class="step">
        <view class="step-dot">3</view>
        <view class="step-text">完成绑定后再填写儿童档案</view>
      </view>
    </view>

    <button class="primary-btn" bindtap="onBindDeviceTap">绑定设备</button>
  </view>
</view>
